# Local-only prepublish-check.py allowlist (real hostnames/emails/IPs
# this operator doesn't want the public-repo scanner to flag) — never
# committed, since committing it would be the leak the scanner exists
# to catch. See scripts/prepublish-check.py and docs/maintainers.md.
.prepublish-markers.local
